<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glūbo</span></b> , ĕre,
			v. a. and n.
		Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλύφω</span>; cf. sculpo
		(ante-class.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to deprive of its
			bark</i>, <i>to bark</i>, <i>peel</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salictum glubito arteque alligato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 33, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ramos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 55, 2</span></i>
			.—In mal. part.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(Lesbia) Glubit magnanimos Remi nepotes (v.
					deglubo),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					58, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to cast off its
			shell</i> or <i>bark</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">materies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 31, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">17, 1</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
